 Brand Guidelines & Logos Calendar Campus Map Request Transcripts Transportation Services About / Careers / Reloads current page: Open-Rank Professor of Biology Open-Rank Professor of Biology Full-time Southern Virginia University seeks applications for an Open-Rank Professor of Biology to begin August 2027. This position requires teaching undergraduate courses to support the biology, biochemistry, and environmental studies programs. Assigned courses taught may include introductory biology (majors and nonmajors), environmental science, botany, and ecology. Other courses may be assigned based upon the needs of the program and the interests/expertise of the candidate. Responsibilities Teach biology courses including labs (~3-4 per semester) Develop and refine course materials Advise and mentor students Fulfill faculty service assignments Minimum Qualifications Master’s degree in Biology (or related field) The ability to teach undergraduate courses in biology Strong communicator and a love of teaching Preferred Qualifications The ideal candidate will have either a PhD in biology, ecology, botany, environmental science, or related field Experience teaching in higher education or Advanced Placement (AP) courses in high school Applications Applications should include: (1) a letter of interest (addressing the desired qualifications, the university’s mission, and evidence of teaching effectiveness), (2) a current CV, (3) a statement of teaching philosophy, and (4) a list of 3 professional references with contact information. These materials should be sent as a single PDF to Opens email to Provost provost@svu.edu . Review of applications will begin immediately and will continue until the position is filled. About Southern Virginia University Southern Virginia University is a private, faith-based institution of higher education aligned with the restored gospel of Jesus Christ as taught by The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints. As a university, we gather faithful Latter-day Saints and those who share our values, lift intellectually, socially, and spiritually, and launch into successful lives and careers. Applicants are invited to learn more about the university at svu.edu/mission . Gather. Lift. Launch. Subscribe to our Newsletter About Our Mission Faith in Jesus Christ Careers News Blog Admissions How to Apply Affordability Scholarships & Grants Visit Campus Links Knight Athletics Bookstore Canvas Catalog Library Knight App Make a Payment my svu Resources Accreditation Alumni Apparel & Gifts Brand Guidelines & Logos Calendar Campus Map Request Transcripts Transportation Services Help Contact Us / Directory Accessibility Statement Privacy Policy Cookie Policy Campus Map Title IX Safety & Security Reports Report a Concern New Tab, Instagram New Tab, Facebook New Tab, Youtube New Tab, LinkedIn ©2026 Southern Virginia University  • phone link 540-261-8400 •  1 University Hill Drive, Buena Vista, VA 24416  • link Privacy Policy"
