tion Alumni Apparel & Gifts Brand Guidelines & Logos Calendar Campus Map Request Transcripts Transportation Services About / Careers / Reloads current page: Open Rank Professor of Management/Organizational Behavior Open-Rank Professor of Management and Organizational Behavior Full-time Southern Virginia University seeks applications for an Open-Rank Professor in Management/Organizational Behavior to begin Spring Semester 2027. Primary responsibilities include teaching, undergraduate advising, and university service. The ideal candidate demonstrates a strong commitment to excellence in teaching and collegial collaboration in a liberal arts and business environment. Responsibilities The position requires mentorship of students, course development, curriculum revision, and continued improvement of the business major. Teaching responsibilities include principles of management/organizational behavior, human resources, and leadership courses and related courses in the business major. Minimum Qualifications Doctoral degree (Ph.D.) in Organizational Behavior/Management or related field. The ideal candidate will have evidence of effective teaching in small classes. Candidates should have graduate training and teaching experience in the field. Preferred Qualifications Doctoral degree (Ph.D.) in Organizational Behavior/Management or related field is required. Applications Applications should include a CV, a letter of interest (addressing the desired qualifications, the university’s mission, and evidence of teaching effectiveness), and a list of 3 professional references. These materials should be sent as a single PDF to Opens email to Provost provost@svu.edu . A sample of research may also be included in a separate PDF. We will begin a formal review on September 15, 2026. Applications will be accepted until the position is filled. About Southern Virginia University Southern Virginia University is a private, faith-based institution of higher education aligned with the restored gospel of Jesus Christ as taught by The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints. As a university, we gather faithful Latter-day Saints and those who share our values, lift intellectually, socially, and spiritually, and launch into successful lives and careers. Applicants are invited to learn more about the university at svu.edu/mission . Gather. Lift. Launch. Subscribe to our Newsletter About Our Mission Faith in Jesus Christ Careers News Blog Admissions How to Apply Affordability Scholarships & Grants Visit Campus Links Knight Athletics Bookstore Canvas Catalog Library Knight App Make a Payment my svu Resources Accreditation Alumni Apparel & Gifts Brand Guidelines & Logos Calendar Campus Map Request Transcripts Transportation Services Help Contact Us / Directory Accessibility Statement Privacy Policy Cookie Policy Campus Map Title IX Safety & Security Reports Report a Concern New Tab, Instagram New Tab, Facebook New Tab, Youtube New Tab, LinkedIn ©2026 Southern Virginia University  • phone link 540-261-8400 •  1 University Hill Drive, Buena Vista, VA 24416  • link Privacy Policy"
